WEBVTT

00:06:27.516 --> 00:06:30.756
for one of the biggest problems
in renewable energy systems:

00:06:30.796 --> 00:06:32.116
the storage problem.

00:06:32.636 --> 00:06:34.756
When there's too much wind and sun,

00:06:34.756 --> 00:06:39.156
you can convert the unused electricity
to a liquid green fuel

00:06:39.156 --> 00:06:41.476
that can be used
in many different industries.

00:06:42.636 --> 00:06:44.956
So what are the challenges?

00:06:46.756 --> 00:06:52.116
Well, I often hear the same concern
when it comes to sustainability.

00:06:52.156 --> 00:06:53.436
"Can we afford it?"

00:06:54.396 --> 00:06:56.756
And yes, it is true that this green fuel

00:06:56.756 --> 00:06:59.556
is more expensive
than the bunker fuel we use today.

00:06:59.556 --> 00:07:03.436
In fact, it is two
to three times more expensive